        <p>You are staring at a screen in a quiet Downcity office at six in the morning. The coffee is cold, and the analytics dashboard shows traffic flatlining again. A competitor on Federal Hill just signed the exact client you pitched last week. You know they found them through a basic Google search. That visibility gap is costing you real revenue. Fixing it requires Providence search engine optimization that actually aligns with how Rhode Islanders buy.</p>
        
